h the changes since the last build.What are Milestones?In short: you don't have to do anything. They don't unlock anything. They're here so you can look at them. They are not achievements. There's no in-game currency, so we can't give you coins for them either. Sorry about all that.First of all: Milestones existed before, but they were just simple counters with weird tech","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:41:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5041330-1846018067929480","game_id":"steam-5041330","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.42 update: Meet DORIS, your new personal assistant","summary":"Hello everyone,Thank you for playing the demo. Today we want to show you the original, unfiltered Groundwork experience, and our biggest public update, both for the game and the demo.Groundwork is a passion project made by two people. We started working on it in 2019, when it was just a tiny JS-based clicker game: no robots, no round planets, not even a rocket. Since then, we have worked through years of concepts and gameplay ideas, learning cool stuff every day. We are planning an early Decembe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T12:29:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5041330-1844751498229677","game_id":"steam-5041330","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.34.4 update","summary":"Hello everyone,We changed how the game loads its models. On some PCs the game froze before reaching the title screen. Now it starts normally.We also fixed saves that showed \"Damaged or modified\" and could not be continued. This happened on days when the planet had a special condition, such as long nights. Nothing was lost: those saves load again with this update.The demo has two limitations: you can't meet the robot that lets you build houses for the humans, which is how the full game moves forw","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T17:38:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229677","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5041330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5041330":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5041330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z"},"5282090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:18Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5041330","app_id":5041330,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7e4c79b5085af9af13a419a0c773aee8111b80e8f1417acc1b9391465642e33d","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"인간들이 옵니다. 누군가는 이곳을 준비해야 합니다. 이곳에서 자라는 것들을 스캔하고, 채집하고 채굴하세요. 추락한 우주선의 로봇들을 수리하면 새 제작법을 알려 주고 일을 맡아 줍니다. 인간과 로봇의 새 보금자리를 지으세요. 전투도, 제한 시간도, 실패 화면도 없습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Peak Development"}],"developers":[{"name":"Peak Development"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_s